      "current_title": "Tell HN: Political Detox Week – No politics on HN for one week",
      "excerpt": "Like everyone else, HN has been on a political binge lately. As an experiment, we're going to try something new and have a cleanse. Starting today, it's Political Detox Week on HN. For one week, political stories are off-topic. Please flag them. Please also flag political threads on non-political stories. For our part, we'll kill such stories and threads when we see them. Then we'll watch together to see what happens. Why? Political conflicts cause harm here. The values of Ha",
      "rank": 1,
      "guide_zh": "HN 试行一周“政治排毒”，暂时将政治新闻与相关讨论列为离题内容。"
